# Documentation

Update the living doc in the same change that changes the decision:

- `docs/SYSTEM_DESIGN.md`
- `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`
- `docs/DATA_FLOW.md`
- `docs/SECURITY_MODEL.md`
- `docs/DEPLOYMENT.md`
- `docs/CONTRIBUTING.md`
- `docs/MILESTONES.md` when the sequence changes

A material decision gets an ADR in `docs/adr/` with context, decision, alternatives, and consequences. Record tradeoffs for a release in `CHANGELOG.md`.
